// The direct control protocol of decision-016: one bidirectional stream per
// Worker, opened by the Worker to the Control Leader, carrying the Worker's
// projection of the Leader's desired set as a snapshot and then one-step
// deltas, and the Worker's receipts per version back.
//
// What travels is references. An entry names a Query Group's execution
// object and output contexts by digest; the bytes are read through the
// content-addressed catalog, or fetched on this stream by ObjectRequest
// when the catalog cannot serve them. Nothing on this stream is a lease:
// assignment facts are a preview of the Assignment record, and the
// authority a Worker executes under is what its lease renewal reads back
// from that record. Heartbeats extend nothing.

